      "text": "Nestled in Okaloosa County, Ocean City is a primarily residential area that offers a quiet alternative to the high‑energy tourist centers of the Florida Panhandle.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        23
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
